{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2022-03-15 06:05:00', 'title': "AES NAMED TO LIST OF WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE NINTH YEAR", 'text': "AES IS ONE OF ONLY NINE IN THE ENERGY AND UTILITIES SECTOR TO BE RECOGNIZED FOR ITS INTEGRITY AND HIGH STANDARDS IN ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES\xa0 ARLINGTON, VA., MARCH 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES) HAS BEEN NAMED ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR BY ETHISPHERE INSTITUTE , A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES."}